# T-1542 / T-1539: Multiple structural bodies in a [type ...] declaration are rejected.
# [type [foo: String] [bar: Int]] would be two structural alias bodies — this is an error.
# Use [or [foo: String] [bar: Int]] for a union of structural types.
[type [foo: String] [bar: Int]]
=== error
structural alias must have exactly one body; use [or ...] for a union of structural types
